title Cassette: the recordings list (board CassetteList) opened with L: five takes, Take 006 selected; Down moves the highlight, a tap selects a row; Esc comes back
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key l
wait 400
expect text "Take 007"
expect text "Take 006"
expect text "RENAME"
expect text "EDIT"
expect text "DELETE"
@480x320,640x480 expect text "Take 006 selected. Esc returns to the recorder."
shot list
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key down
wait 300
@480x320,640x480 expect text "Take 005 selected. Esc returns to the recorder."
tap "Take 007"
wait 300
@480x320,640x480 expect text "Take 007 selected. Esc returns to the recorder."
say Down and a tap moved the highlight (list_select)
@480x320,640x480 scrollmark
@480x320,640x480 dragon "Take 005" -0.15
@480x320,640x480 expect scrolled
@480x320,640x480 say a drag that starts on a row scrolled the list (portrait shows all five rows)
shot list-scrolled
key esc
wait 300
expect text "SOFT"
expect notext "RENAME"
expect noquit
